{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Photo-Life - Rina's Journey!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Rina in her travels and assist her as photographer during a complete year!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Listen to her and help her chose between two careers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Edit the shoots and send them to the agency for validation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/fd1262b9bf34c10dbfa95028b6f1d8a7.avif?t=1728315958\" width=600 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is split in 11 acts leading to 2 different ends:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" width=15 height=20 /></span>Sundress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" width=15 height=20 /></span>Beach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" width=15 height=20 /></span>Casual</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08.webp?t=1728315958\" width=15 height=20 /></span>Home Sweet Home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573420/extras/e9b008bd7de836691b0fc11568e05d08